# .aiignore — files excluded from AI-agent context.
# Rule home: docs/00_06 §4 (Ruthless Pruning).
#
# Legacy / superseded material is kept ONLY for historical or educational
# reference. Excluding it from AI context stops LLM agents from "resurrecting"
# dead concepts (e.g. streaming-potential as an energy source, the U.FL coax
# antenna cable, the 4-needle Kelvin electrode probe). SSOT for the CURRENT
# architecture lives in the active docs/NN_NN_*.md tree — see docs/00_00 for
# the reading order.
#
# NB: this convention is honoured by Cursor (.cursorignore) and similar agents;
# it is advisory for tools without native support.
#
# (No entries currently: 02_04 was repurposed from a legacy appendix into a
# live bench-build guide — docs/02_04_Bench_Build_Guide.md — now under the full
# docs-gate. Add a path here only when a genuinely dead artifact is archived.)
